  "description": "Cycling adventures come in all sizes, and so do those seeking them. So, with adults catered for in our award-winning ADV (adventure) range, we felt it only fair that those of smaller stature can also experience the biggest adventures.\n\nThe ADV 26\" shares much of the same DNA as its 700c counterparts. A triple-butted aluminium frame and alloy fork provide a stable and confidence-inspiring ride whilst offering maximum versatility with luggage and mudguard mounts. The Vee Speedster multi-surface, mid-tread 1.5\" tyres are a superb fast rolling option for tarmac and light trail use, and are easily changed out to something more aggressive, should the adventure demand it.\n\nErgonomic drop handlebars and powerful cable disk brakes enhance the comfort and control further still, and with a wide range ratio nine-speed cassette, the ADV 26\" is the perfect partner for cycling adventures, big or small.",
